# Purpose

This template provides a standardized log for recording all maintenance activities performed on a property managed under the Property Operations Guide (POG).

The Maintenance Log creates a permanent history of preventive maintenance, corrective repairs, emergency work, and capital improvements.

Completed maintenance logs belong in the future Private Operations Repository.

