# Usage Notes

Every maintenance activity affecting the property should be recorded.

Routine entries may be brief.

Major repairs should include detailed documentation, costs, photographs, warranties, and lessons learned.

---

# Guiding Principle

The maintenance log is the property's memory.

Every repair, inspection finding, and improvement contributes to a better understanding of the property's condition and helps future owners or managers make informed decisions.